                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "Text",
                  "settings": {
                    "visibility": "always-display",
                    "text": "<p>If your order arrives damaged, misprinted, or wrong, email us within 30 days with a photo and we'll replace it free — no return needed.</p><p>Wrong size? We'll exchange it within 30 days. You cover shipping it back, we cover shipping the new one out.</p><p>Changed your mind? Return it within 30 days for a refund. You cover return shipping and the original shipping cost comes off the refund. Items need to be unworn and unwashed either way.</p><p>See our full policy <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\" title=\"Refund Policy\">here.</a></p>",
